{"step_index":18,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-10T10:05:49Z","input_tokens":19521,"cache_read_tokens":49064,"output_tokens":2222,"thinking":"Planning to modify the stylesheet to visually highlight the execution order of code lines. The goal is to make it easy for beginners to trace the sequence, so badges like \"#1\", \"#2\", and \"#3\" will be added near relevant lines. This should improve the clarity of the code's execution flow.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"Append":true,"CodeContent":"\n/* Step 2 Additions: Execution Order Badges, Loop/Condition/Function Deep Visualizers & Variable History Table */\n\n.exec-order-pill {\n  font-size: 10px;\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  padding: 1px 5px;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  background: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.12);\n  color: #94a3b8;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.25);\n}\n\n.exec-order-pill.latest-step {\n  background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.25);\n  color: #c7d2fe;\n  border-color: var(--accent-primary);\n  font-weight: 700;\n}\n\n/* Mechanics Visual Cards (Loop, Condition, Function) */\n.mechanics-card {\n  background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.92), rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.85));\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-highlight);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  padding: 12px 14px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.mechanics-card.loop-card {\n  border-color: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.45);\n}\n\n.mechanics-card.cond-card {\n  border-color: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.45);\n}\n\n.mechanics-card.func-card {\n  border-color: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.45);\n}\n\n.loop-strip {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 6px;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  margin-top: 4px;\n}\n\n.loop-item-box {\n  background: var(--bg-input);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-highlight);\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  padding: 5px 9px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: center;\n  min-width: 42px;\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n}\n\n.loop-item-box.past-item {\n  opacity: 0.5;\n  border-color: #1e293b;\n}\n\n.loop-item-box.current-item {\n  background: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.2);\n  border: 1.5px solid var(--accent-secondary);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.25);\n}\n\n.loop-item-ptr {\n  font-size: 9px;\n  color: #22d3ee;\n  font-weight: 700;\n}\n\n.loop-item-val {\n  font-size: 12.5px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--text-primary);\n}\n\n/* Condition Evaluator Grid */\n.cond-eval-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr auto;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n  background: var(--bg-input);\n  padding: 8px 10px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 12px;\n}\n\n.cond-operand {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 2px;\n}\n\n.cond-expr-label {\n  font-size: 10px;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n}\n\n.cond-expr-val {\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: #e2e8f0;\n}\n\n.cond-op-badge {\n  padding: 2px 7px;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.18);\n  color: #fbbf24;\n  font-weight: 700;\n}\n\n.cond-verdict {\n  padding: 4px 10px;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  font-size: 12px;\n}\n\n.cond-verdict.verdict-true {\n  background: var(--accent-success-bg);\n  color: #34d399;\n  border: 1px solid var(--accent-success);\n}\n\n.cond-verdict.verdict-false {\n  background: var(--accent-danger-bg);\n  color: #f87171;\n  border: 1px solid var(--accent-danger);\n}\n\n/* Function Parameter Binding Rows */\n.param-map-list {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 6px;\n}\n\n.param-map-row {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  background: var(--bg-input);\n  padding: 6px 10px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 12px;\n}\n\n/* Big Picture Senior Mentor Banner */\n.mentor-banner {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.14), rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.1));\n  border: 1px solid rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.35);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  padding: 10px 12px;\n  font-size: 12.5px;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n  color: #dbeafe;\n}\n\n/* Variable History Timeline Table */\n.timeline-table {\n  width: 100%;\n  border-collapse: collapse;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n}\n\n.timeline-table th,\n.timeline-table td {\n  padding: 7px 8px;\n  text-align: left;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n}\n\n.timeline-table th {\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  font-size: 10.5px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.8);\n  position: sticky;\n  top: 0;\n}\n\n.timeline-table tr.active-history-row {\n  background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.2);\n}\n\n.timeline-table tr:hover {\n  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n","Description":"Add styles for execution order badges, loop/condition/function mechanics cards, and variable timeline table","Overwrite":false,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\CVT\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\code-flow-visualizer\\styles.css","toolAction":"Adding Step 2 styles to styles.css","toolSummary":"Append Step 2 visual styles to styles.css"}}]}
