{"step_index":20,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-10T10:06:15Z","input_tokens":5518,"cache_read_tokens":65425,"output_tokens":2940,"thinking":"Initial plan is to modify the HTML and JavaScript to display the nine beginner questions. The goal is interactive rendering of all the questions specified in Step 2. Focus will be on prominently surfacing each question within the UI.\n\n\nThe Mentor Panel will be enhanced with a \"Developer Big Picture\" banner to provide context. Each code line will feature an execution order trail, clarifying the sequence. Interactive visualizer cards will appear during execution, providing insights into loop internals, condition evaluation, and function parameter binding/return mechanisms. A \"How Python Decides Which Line Executes Next\" section will be added. The Memory Panel will include a tab switcher for live memory, call stack, final answer, and variable timeline visualization.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <title>CodeFlow AI — Interactive Python Execution & Logic Visualizer</title>\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\" />\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <!-- Top Navigation & Curriculum Bar -->\n  <header class=\"app-header\">\n    <div class=\"brand\">\n      <div class=\"brand-logo\">CF</div>\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"brand-title\">\n          CodeFlow Studio\n          <span class=\"badge-ai\">Patient Senior Dev Mentor</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"brand-subtitle\">Understand every line, variable, loop, condition, function &amp; final calculation step by step</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"header-controls\">\n      <div class=\"control-group\">\n        <span class=\"control-label\">Lesson / Preset:</span>\n        <select id=\"presetSelect\" class=\"preset-select\" aria-label=\"Select Code Example\"></select>\n      </div>\n      <button id=\"btnEditToggle\" class=\"btn\">Edit Code</button>\n      <button id=\"btnRunTrace\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">⚡ Visualize Execution</button>\n      <button id=\"btnQuizMode\" class=\"btn btn-quiz\">Predict Next Step</button>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <!-- Step-by-Step Time-Travel Transport Bar -->\n  <section class=\"transport-bar\">\n    <div class=\"transport-buttons\">\n      <button id=\"btnFirst\" class=\"btn btn-icon\" title=\"First Step\">|&lt;&lt;</button>\n      <button id=\"btnPrev\" class=\"btn btn-icon\" title=\"Step Backward (Left Arrow)\">&lt; Prev</button>\n      <button id=\"btnPlay\" class=\"btn btn-play\" title=\"Play / Pause (Space)\">Play</button>\n      <button id=\"btnNext\" class=\"btn btn-icon\" title=\"Step Forward (Right Arrow)\">Next &gt;</button>\n      <button id=\"btnLast\" class=\"btn btn-icon\" title=\"Last Step\">&gt;&gt;|</button>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"scrubber-container\">\n      <span id=\"stepCounter\" class=\"step-counter\">Step 1 / 1</span>\n      <div class=\"scrubber-track-wrapper\">\n        <input id=\"timelineSlider\" type=\"range\" class=\"timeline-slider\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" value=\"0\" />\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"speed-controls\">\n      <span class=\"control-label\">Speed:</span>\n      <button class=\"speed-pill\" data-speed=\"1800\">0.5x</button>\n      <button class=\"speed-pill active\" data-speed=\"1100\">1x</button>\n      <button class=\"speed-pill\" data-speed=\"550\">2x</button>\n      <button class=\"speed-pill\" data-speed=\"250\">4x</button>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Main 3-Column Interactive Workspace -->\n  <main class=\"workspace-grid\">\n\n    <!-- LEFT PANEL: Source Code Execution Order & Live Console -->\n    <section class=\"panel\">\n      <div class=\"panel-header\">\n        <div class=\"panel-title\">\n          <span class=\"dot dot-blue\"></span>\n          Python Source &amp; Line Execution Order\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"legend-pills\">\n          <span class=\"legend-item\"><span class=\"legend-box legend-current\"></span>Current Line</span>\n          <span class=\"legend-item\"><span class=\"legend-box legend-next\"></span>Next Line</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"code-container\">\n        <div class=\"code-mode-banner\">\n          <span>Step badges (<code>#1</code>, <code>#2</code>...) show exact line execution order. Click any line to jump to that step.</span>\n        </div>\n        <div id=\"codeTraceView\" class=\"code-trace-view\"></div>\n        <textarea id=\"codeEditorTextarea\" class=\"code-editor-textarea hidden\" spellcheck=\"false\"></textarea>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"console-panel\">\n        <div class=\"panel-header\">\n          <div class=\"panel-title\">\n            <span class=\"dot dot-green\"></span>\n            Final Output &amp; Console (Stdout)\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div id=\"consoleBody\" class=\"console-body\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- CENTER PANEL: Control Flow Graph + Live Variable & Final Calculation History -->\n    <section class=\"panel\">\n      <div class=\"center-split\">\n\n        <!-- Visual Control Flow Diagram -->\n        <div class=\"flow-canvas-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"panel-header\">\n            <div class=\"panel-title\">\n              <span class=\"dot dot-purple\"></span>\n              Control Flow Graph (How Program Decides Path)\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div id=\"flowSvgContainer\" class=\"flow-svg-container\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Live Variables, Call Stack & Final Answer Calculation History -->\n        <div class=\"memory-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"panel-header\">\n            <div class=\"panel-title\">\n              <span class=\"dot dot-cyan\"></span>\n              Memory &amp; Calculation Tracker\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"panel-actions\">\n              <button id=\"tabLiveMemory\" class=\"tab-btn active\">Live Variables</button>\n              <button id=\"tabVarHistory\" class=\"tab-btn\">How Final Answer is Calculated</button>\n              <span id=\"frameCountBadge\" class=\"badge-ai\">1 Frame</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div id=\"memoryScroll\" class=\"memory-scroll\"></div>\n          <div id=\"historyScroll\" class=\"memory-scroll hidden\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- RIGHT PANEL: Patient Senior Developer AI Mentor Panel -->\n    <section class=\"panel\">\n      <div class=\"panel-header\">\n        <div class=\"panel-title\">\n          <span class=\"dot dot-amber\"></span>\n          Senior Developer Mentor (Line-by-Line Guide)\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"tutor-body\">\n        <!-- Explanation Depth Switcher -->\n        <div class=\"depth-selector\">\n          <button class=\"depth-btn\" data-depth=\"eli5\">🌱 Friendly Analogy</button>\n          <button class=\"depth-btn active\" data-depth=\"beginner\">👨‍💻 Senior Dev Mentor</button>\n          <button class=\"depth-btn\" data-depth=\"deep\">⚙️ Under the Hood</button>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Big Picture Why Code Works This Way -->\n        <div id=\"bigPictureBanner\" class=\"mentor-banner\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Current Step Hero Summary -->\n        <div class=\"step-hero-card\">\n          <div class=\"step-hero-header\">\n            <span id=\"eventBadge\" class=\"event-badge\">PROGRAM START</span>\n            <span id=\"stepLineBadge\" class=\"step-line-badge\">Line 1</span>\n          </div>\n          <div id=\"stepCodePreview\" class=\"step-code-preview\"></div>\n          <div id=\"evalBreakdownBox\" class=\"eval-breakdown-box\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Dynamic Internal Mechanics Visualizer (Loops / Conditions / Functions) -->\n        <div id=\"mechanicsContainer\" class=\"hidden\"></div>\n\n        <!-- 1. What Just Happened -->\n        <div class=\"explanation-section\">\n          <div class=\"explanation-label\">💡 What Happens on This Step</div>\n          <div id=\"whatHappenedText\" class=\"explanation-text\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- 2. How Program Decides Which Line Executes Next -->\n        <div class=\"explanation-section\">\n          <div class=\"explanation-label\">🧭 How Python Decides Which Line Runs Next</div>\n          <div id=\"howNextDecidedText\" class=\"explanation-text\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- 3. Why Does the Code Work This Way? -->\n        <div class=\"explanation-section\">\n          <div class=\"explanation-label\">🔍 Why It Works This Way</div>\n          <div id=\"whyHappenedText\" class=\"explanation-text\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- 4. What Happens Next -->\n        <div class=\"explanation-section\">\n          <div class=\"explanation-label\">⏭️ Up Next</div>\n          <div id=\"whatNextText\" class=\"explanation-text\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Optional Prediction Quiz Card -->\n        <div id=\"quizCard\" class=\"quiz-card hidden\">\n          <div class=\"explanation-label\" style=\"color:#d8b4fe;\">🧠 Predict Before Stepping</div>\n          <div id=\"quizQuestion\" class=\"explanation-text\"></div>\n          <div id=\"quizOptions\" class=\"quiz-options\"></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Interactive Ask AI Tutor Footer -->\n      <div class=\"ai-chat-section\">\n        <div class=\"quick-chips\">\n          <button class=\"chip-btn\" data-question=\"How did the final answer get calculated?\">How final answer is calculated?</button>\n          <button class=\"chip-btn\" data-question=\"How does Python decide which line is next?\">Why this next line?</button>\n          <button class=\"chip-btn\" data-question=\"How do loops and conditions work here?\">Explain loop/condition</button>\n        </div>\n        <div id=\"aiAnswerBubble\" class=\"ai-answer-bubble hidden\"></div>\n        <div class=\"chat-input-row\">\n          <input id=\"chatInput\" type=\"text\" class=\"chat-input\" placeholder=\"Ask your Senior Dev Mentor any question...\" />\n          <button id=\"btnAskAi\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Ask</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n  </main>\n\n  <script src=\"tracer.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"app.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","Description":"Update index.html with Senior Dev Mentor sections, Mechanics Visualizer container, Execution Order trail, and Final Calculation History tab","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\CVT\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\code-flow-visualizer\\index.html","toolAction":"Updating index.html for Step 2 mentor goals","toolSummary":"Update index.html with Step 2 beginner mentor panels"}}]}
